WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:16.180
Nobody moved a muscle.

2
00:00:16.921 --> 00:00:18.862
Even Gub-Gub stopped crying.

3
00:00:19.523 --> 00:00:22.105
Two large bodies walked out of the trees.

4
00:00:22.786 --> 00:00:25.208
Suddenly, Chee-Chee let out a scream.

5
00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:33.337
Chee-Chee was speaking very fast.

6
00:00:34.097 --> 00:00:35.577
"What's he saying, Polynesia?"

7
00:00:36.037 --> 00:00:37.278
Dr. Dolittle asked.

8
00:00:38.018 --> 00:00:39.718
"It's the language of the monkeys.

9
00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:43.600
I don't understand it," Polynesia shook her head.

10
00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:47.041
Chee-Chee walked back with two big monkeys.

11
00:00:47.061 --> 00:00:51.142
"Do not be afraid," one of them said.

12
00:00:51.162 --> 00:00:53.102
"We've come for Dr.

13
00:00:53.142 --> 00:00:54.903
Dolittle," the other said.

14
00:00:54.923 --> 00:00:56.923
"It's an honor to meet you."

15
00:00:56.943 --> 00:00:58.604
"I'm honored as well."

16
00:00:59.568 --> 00:01:01.449
The doctor also beat his chest.

17
00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.110
Suddenly the trees began moving again.

18
00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.751
This time, a whole army of monkeys walked out.

19
00:01:09.771 --> 00:01:11.952
"Oh, there are so many!"

20
00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:13.392
cried Gub-Gub.

21
00:01:13.912 --> 00:01:16.453
Together the monkeys started to beat their chests.

22
00:01:16.473 --> 00:01:21.494
"The Land of the Monkeys welcomes you, Dr.

23
00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:23.755
Dolittle," Chee-Chee explained.

24
00:01:24.715 --> 00:01:27.316
Meanwhile, the king's guards heard the monkeys.

25
00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:32.847
"This time they will not escape," the leader of the guards smiled.

26
00:01:33.807 --> 00:01:36.068
No one saw the guards coming toward them.

27
00:01:36.088 --> 00:01:41.992
"We're almost there," said a very large monkey.

28
00:01:42.012 --> 00:01:44.193
"Why is it so far?"

29
00:01:44.713 --> 00:01:45.634
whined Gub-Gub.

30
00:01:45.654 --> 00:01:47.995
"Do not worry, my pink friend.

31
00:01:48.555 --> 00:01:51.057
I will carry you," the large monkey said.

32
00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:56.140
At that moment, the king's guards ran out from behind.

33
00:01:57.268 --> 00:01:58.909
"We got you now, prisoner!"

34
00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.350
shouted the leader.

35
00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.453
"It's Jolliginki's guards!"

36
00:02:03.913 --> 00:02:04.773
yelled a monkey.

37
00:02:04.794 --> 00:02:07.155
"Quickly! To the river!"

38
00:02:07.696 --> 00:02:08.656
cried out another.

39
00:02:09.377 --> 00:02:13.780
But all the humans heard was this, "Uga boong-ga goog-ga gu!"

40
00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.483
"Yuk! Hoong-ga!"

41
00:02:17.543 --> 00:02:20.365
Dr. Dolittle was not as fast as the animals.

42
00:02:21.285 --> 00:02:22.226
"Dr. Dolittle!"

43
00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:23.227
barked Jip.

44
00:02:25.068 --> 00:02:27.290
"Ah-ha! You're mine now, medicine man!"

45
00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:28.791
the leader laughed.

46
00:02:29.431 --> 00:02:33.675
Like a bolt of lightning, Jip jumped over and stood in front of Dr.

47
00:02:33.735 --> 00:02:38.639
Dolittle. Jip would not let anyone harm his beloved master.

48
00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.922
The king's guard lifted his spear and pointed it at Jip.

49
00:02:44.123 --> 00:02:46.845
Dr. Dolittle shouted for his dog to get away.

50
00:02:48.327 --> 00:02:54.031
Suddenly from the sky, a coconut fell on top of the leader’s head and then he collapsed on

51
00:02:54.071 --> 00:02:54.552
the ground.

52
00:02:56.744 --> 00:02:59.766
The Land of the Monkeys was just across the river.

53
00:02:59.786 --> 00:03:04.089
"We need to cross this river," Chee-Chee pointed.

54
00:03:04.109 --> 00:03:05.490
"But how?"

55
00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.331
Dab-Dab spoke up.

56
00:03:07.351 --> 00:03:09.973
"Oh, they're getting close!

57
00:03:10.353 --> 00:03:11.254
I can hear them!"

58
00:03:11.774 --> 00:03:12.695
Gub-Gub cried.

59
00:03:13.435 --> 00:03:15.777
The guards' voices echoed from the trees.

60
00:03:15.797 --> 00:03:21.441
"There is only one way," said the monkey carrying Gub-Gub.

61
00:03:21.461 --> 00:03:23.762
"Come on, boys!

62
00:03:23.822 --> 00:03:24.763
Let's make a bridge!"

63
00:03:24.783 --> 00:03:28.068
"Bridge? How are they going to make a bridge?"

64
00:03:28.609 --> 00:03:29.389
wondered Dr.

65
00:03:29.429 --> 00:03:32.270
Dolittle. He stared in surprise.

66
00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:37.171
One by one, the monkeys linked their arms and legs together.

67
00:03:38.091 --> 00:03:39.892
They made a bridge of monkeys.

68
00:03:44.953 --> 00:03:46.874
Dr. Dolittle rubbed his eyes.

69
00:03:46.894 --> 00:03:48.634
"Quickly! Dr.

70
00:03:48.654 --> 00:03:49.974
Dolittle, walk over!

71
00:03:50.195 --> 00:03:52.035
Hurry!" shouted a monkey.

72
00:03:52.795 --> 00:03:55.156
Dr. Dolittle crossed to the other side.

73
00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.101
The others followed quickly after him.

74
00:04:01.422 --> 00:04:03.622
Gub-Gub was the last one to cross.

75
00:04:04.422 --> 00:04:07.063
He cried but he carefully made it across.

76
00:04:07.923 --> 00:04:11.524
One by one, the monkeys unlinked their arms and legs.

77
00:04:12.484 --> 00:04:14.485
The bridge of monkeys was no more.

78
00:04:14.505 --> 00:04:20.607
"You are the only man ever to see the bridge of monkeys, Doctor," said Chee-Chee.

79
00:04:21.347 --> 00:04:23.567
Dr. Dolittle felt very proud.
